Library           taf.gnb.oam.megazone_client    WITH NAME    megazone_client
Library           taf.transport.ssh    WITH NAME    csn
Library           Process
Library           OperatingSystem
Library           Collections
Library           DateTime
Library           String


*** Variables ***
${WEBUI_URL}                https://${tl.gnbs[0].dus[0].airscale.common_units[0].lmp_connection.addr}
${WEBUI_USER}               Nemuadmin
${WEBUI_PASSWORD}           nemuuser
${asik_addr}                ${tl.gnbs[0].dus[0].airscale.common_units[0].lmp_connection.addr}
${asik_username}            ${tl.gnbs[0].dus[0].airscale.common_units[0].lmp_connection.username}
${asik_password}            ${tl.gnbs[0].dus[0].airscale.common_units[0].lmp_connection.password}
${TS_LOG_PATH_BASE}         /root/workspace/CIT/Master/Case_Logs

*** Keywords ***
Common Suite Setup
    [Documentation]    this keyword create suite name directory path as ${OUTPUT_DIR}//logs//
    Set Suite Variable      ${OUTPUT_PATH}    ${TS_LOG_PATH_BASE}
    ${ts_name}=    Replace String    ${SUITE NAME}    ${SPACE}    _
    megazone_client.create session    base_url=${WEBUI_URL}
    ${SW_version} =     megazone_client.get sw version
    ${suite_log_path}    Join path    ${OUTPUT_PATH}    ${sw_version}    TS_${ts_name}
    megazone_client.teardown session
    Set Suite Variable    ${SUITE_LOG_PATH}    ${suite_log_path}
    Create directory    ${SUITE_LOG_PATH}

Common Test Teardown
    [Documentation]    Do some common thing for every postcondition of cases
    [Timeout]  15 min
    Backup SCF file
    Collect journal logs
    Collect classical gNB all logs
    Collect snapshot log

Backup SCF file
    megazone_client.create session    base_url=${WEBUI_URL}
    megazone_client.get_current_scf_file      ${TS_CASE_LOG_PATH}     SCF_Backup.xml
    megazone_client.teardown session

Collect journal logs
    csn.connect_to    ${asik_addr}    ${asik_username}    ${asik_password}    alias=OAM
    csn.execute     journalctl -b > /tmp/journal.log    connection=OAM
    run process    sudo sshpass -p ${asik_password} scp ${asik_username}@${asik_addr}:/tmp/journal.log ${TS_CASE_LOG_PATH}  shell=yes

Collect classical gNB all logs
    [Documentation]    Need to put the "classicalbts_log_collector.sh" file under /opt/tool/ on testPC
    Run Keyword And Continue On Failure    OperatingSystem.File Should Exist    /opt/tool/classicalbts_log_collector.sh
    Run Keyword And Continue On Failure    run process
    ...    sudo sshpass -p ${asik_password} scp /opt/tool/classicalbts_log_collector.sh ${asik_username}@${asik_addr}:/user/toor4nsn/   shell=yes
    csn.connect_to    ${asik_addr}    ${asik_username}    ${asik_password}    alias=OAM
    csn.execute     chmod 777 /user/toor4nsn/classicalbts_log_collector.sh   connection=OAM
    csn.send command    rm -r /user/toor4nsn/all_log_collected/*    connection=OAM
    ${connection} =    csn.get connection by alias    alias=OAM
    ${channel} =    Call Method    ${connection}    invoke_shell
    Call Method    ${channel}    send    cd /user/toor4nsn;./classicalbts_log_collector.sh -o ./all_log_collected/\n
    Sleep    10s
    Call Method    ${channel}    recv      ${65535}
    Call Method    ${channel}    send    ${asik_password}\n
    Sleep    10s
    run process
    ...    sudo sshpass -p ${asik_password} scp -r ${asik_username}@${asik_addr}:/user/toor4nsn/all_log_collected/ ${TS_CASE_LOG_PATH}   shell=yes
    csn.disconnect    connection=OAM

Collect snapshot log
    megazone_client.create_session   base_url=${WEBUI_URL}
    megazone_client.make_snapshot    ${TS_CASE_LOG_PATH}/snapshot.zip
    ...                             timeout=900    rap=["RAP 1"]
    megazone_client.teardown_session

Common Test Setup
    [Documentation]    this keyword create case name directory path as ${OUTPUT_DIR}//${SUITE_LOG_PATH}//
    Create log directory

Create log directory
    [Documentation]    Author: Ding Binmei
    ...                Description: Open a common variable "TS_CASE_LOG_PATH" and also create test case log path
    ${tc_name}=    Replace String    ${TEST NAME}    ${SPACE}    _
    Common Suite Setup
    ${case_log_path}    Join path    ${SUITE_LOG_PATH}    TC_${tc_name}
    Set Test Variable    ${TS_CASE_LOG_PATH}    ${case_log_path}
    Create directory    ${TS_CASE_LOG_PATH}
